OL,3,GNEWSADevelopers lodge plans for 1,575
OL,4,Ahomes
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for 1,575 homes, a new primary
OL,7,Fschool, sports facilities and land
OL,8,Fearmarked for businesses have been
OL,9,Fsubmitted in Shropshire.
OL,11,FThe development would form the largest
OL,12,Fpart of a proposed 2,100-home community
OL,13,Fbetween Shawbirch and Bratton, on
OL,14,Farable farmland north of Telford.
OL,16,FDevelopers Bloor Homes said the scheme
OL,17,Fwould also include public open spaces
OL,18,Falongside specialist housing for
OL,19,Felderly people.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
